<title>FRANCE: Total aims for 12 pct ROE by 2000 -paper.</title>
<headline>Total aims for 12 pct ROE by 2000 -paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French energy group Total SA wants to boost its return on equity to above 12 percent by 2000, compared to 10 percent currently, chairman Thierry Desmarest said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The group still has an inadequate return on equity,&quot; he said in an interview with business daily Les Echos. &quot;Certainly, it is better, since it has gone in two years from seven to 10 percent, which was the objective fixed.</p>
<p>&quot;We are now aiming for more than 12 percent for 2000, in an environment tougher than today,&quot; he said. The task would be more difficult as the amount of equity was increasing, he added.</p>
</text>
